ent-js-inventory.json`:\n\n- Heap allocation-root publication from #4562.\n- Managed callback termination handling from #4548.\n- Existing managed-object allocation support from #4555.\n- Shared readonly-field admission from #4535.\n\nSource review confirmed that these retain the documented carriers, including frozen `{ h, g }` managed references. Every byte outside the four hash strings is unchanged: schema, result kinds, additional shapes, evidence and unsupported scopes are preserved.\n\n## Validation\n\nThe existing `tests/a00-01-value-abi.test.js` suite passed **19/19 tests**, with no failures, skips or cancellations, through the serial limiter on clean committed source `52bde3173ae86e01cd9fb1d1a8cb01764eb024cb` (tree `874fca7633c61df1f28817db1a6aefae3b0acbf2`).\n\nThe published commit is `bb7d1b8c6ff260a33be4f16a76054f1bfd84e2b8`; its tree exactly matches the tested local commit. No rebase, squash or force push was used.\n\n## Scope and remaining qualification\n\nA fresh audit of all 98 claim records and 13 lock records found no file-path reservation for this nested generated artifact. The separately held generators, contract tests, GC-root documentation and runtime sources are unchanged. This is an artifact-only integration correction; it does not claim another task's ownership.\n\nThe full-CI run remains failed. The separately identified GC-root documentation/test reservation and diagnostic caller corrections still require their own resolution. No full qualification or issue closure is claimed.\n\nTask reference: SF-A00-T01.1","created_at":"2026-10-04T15:04:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T15:05:40Z","closed_at":"2026-10-04T15:05:40Z","merged_at":"2026-10-04T15:05:40Z","merge_commit_sha":"31900dce5c1454c1f9c244c9ac14e1798eac3e5f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":12527915052,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU59Ms88AAAAC6rjQLA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/labels/size/XS","name":"size/XS","color":"3CBF0